WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.504
Welcome to Manulife Vitality Stories!

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:10.110
Once upon a time, Vivian wondered, “What is Manulife Vitality, anyway?”    

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:14.647
So she jumped right into Chapter 1. 

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:21.321
So many Canadians – including Vivian – felt like life insurance was just one of those things you kinda have to have.  

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.690
Where’s the fun in that? 

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.159
So why not make it fun?

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:34.667
Why not transform it into a way for Canadians to save on their insurance, earn discounts on popular brands and live better, healthier lives? 

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.972
That’s why Manulife brought Vitality to life insurance.  

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:43.043
You caught that bit about saving on insurance, right? 

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:47.280
Vivian sure did – and she learned about it in Chapter 2! 

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.918
it’s totally true: 

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:56.656
if you have Family Term with Vitality Plus or Manulife UL with Vitality Plus, 

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.426
you can save on the cost of your insurance. 

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:05.065
You’ll save 10% in your first year, and you can earn even more savings in later years. 

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.801
But, Vivian wondered, how? 

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:11.337
To answer that, let’s move on to Chapter 3.  

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:23.116
Members like Vivian can earn Vitality Points through workouts, steps, sleep quality, vaccinations, dental checkups, completing health reviews – there are just so many ways! 

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:32.158
Those physical activities can be recorded with most wearable devices, like Apple Watch, Garmin, Fitbit and WHOOP, so you can easily get points. 

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:37.997
And as your points increase, so does your Vitality Status and your insurance savings.  

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:42.368
Vivian also clocked that bit about savings on popular brands. 

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.806
In Chapter 4, she got a taste of what she (and you!) can get…  

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.409
Check them out!   

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:56.316
Here’s a hot tip! You can work your monthly payments for Apple Watch down to $0 per month by earning points through workouts and steps.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:02.122
As we close with Chapter 5, Vivian knew with all those savings and rewards – 

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:07.026
not to mention the health benefits – she’d live happily ever after.  

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:12.031
Want to check out more Manulife Vitality “how-to” stories?  

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:15.635
Click on one of the other videos you see here, then you could live happily ever after! 

